Scope and third-party components

The MIT licence above covers the original code in this repository authored for
the "untitled" project (e.g. src/, setup.ts, server.ts, new-session.ts and the
project tooling).

It does NOT cover the bundled audio engine in tools/dough/, which is a separate
program (codeberg.org/uzu/dough) licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License v3.0 or later (AGPL-3.0-or-later). That directory — including the local
patches to dough.c — is governed by tools/dough/LICENSE, not by this file.
The "untitled" code invokes dough as a separate process (stdin / OSC) rather
than linking it, so the two are aggregated, not combined into one work.
